      "message": "1. there is no clear documentation regarding whether `framework-bluetooth-compat-config` should be used anywhere or not, but I am following similar changes in Wifi and added it to the `compat_configs` peroperty of apex module\n\n2. Regarding permission,  `android.permission.LOG_COMPAT_CHANGE` and `android.permission.READ_COMPAT_CHANGE_CONFIG` is needed when https://source.corp.google.com/android-internal/frameworks/base/core/java/android/app/compat/CompatChanges.java;rcl\u003d3aa2031cbc590dac166ba44fad8ad31637ebb921;l\u003d99 is used, which used used for changes to API which will be run in non-APP processes. the affected API in this case is for app usage, so we are using this https://source.corp.google.com/android-internal/frameworks/base/core/java/android/app/compat/CompatChanges.java;l\u003d58;rcl\u003d3aa2031cbc590dac166ba44fad8ad31637ebb921 to determine whether this API change is enabled or not, which does not require these permissions.",
